qs.append({"q":"According to the 'safety valve' theory of the INC's foundation, A.O. Hume intended the Congress to:","o":["Release the growing discontent of Indians to prevent a popular uprising, with Lord Dufferin's cooperation","Directly challenge British sovereignty in India","Serve exclusively as a social reform organisation","Unite Indian princely states against British rule"],"a":0,"e":"The safety valve theory holds that Hume, with Lord Dufferin's tacit cooperation, formed the Congress to channel and defuse growing Indian discontent rather than let it erupt into rebellion."})

qs.append({"q":"Which of the following leaders is associated with belief in the 'safety valve' theory of Congress's origin?","o":["Lala Lajpat Rai","G.K. Gokhale","Bipan Chandra","Womesh Chandra Bonnerjee"],"a":0,"e":"Extremist leader Lala Lajpat Rai believed in the safety valve theory regarding the Congress's founding."})

